{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.DeltaLambdaGeneralNUnconditional","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.DeltaLambdaGeneralNUnconditional","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.DeltaLambdaDTIndexGeneralN","lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NStatConjugateGeneral"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.dtEuler_eq_deltaLambda_unconditional","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.dtEuler_eq_deltaLambda_unconditional","kind":"theorem","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DeltaLambdaGeneralNUnconditional.lean#L35-L45","doc":"**Capstone — the full general-`n` DT unification, UNCONDITIONAL.**  For every\npartition (a-function grade `nStatList l`, Wedderburn dimension `d`) the\nDT/3d-index Euler characteristic equals `Δ_λ` (the **value**), and the\na-function-parity chirality equals the geometric longest-element sign\n`(-1)^{Σ_i C(λ'_i,2)}` (the **sign**) — with no `n ≤ 5` restriction on either\nleg. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:delta-lambda-dt-index-unification","label":"prop:delta-lambda-dt-index-unification","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/delta-lambda-dt-index-unification.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.parity_eq_w0_sign_general","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.parity_eq_w0_sign_general","kind":"theorem","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DeltaLambdaGeneralNUnconditional.lean#L26-L33","doc":"**Geometric-chirality leg, UNCONDITIONAL for all `n`.**  Discharges `(†)` via\n`aStat_eq_sumChoose2_conjugate` (`nStatList` is defeq to `aStat`), removing the\n`n ≤ 5` restriction of `parity_eq_w0_sign_of_nStat_eq_sumChoose2`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}